{#- Changelog section template for commitizen, see `template` in .cz.toml.

    The built-in CHANGELOG.md.j2 without the release date in the version
    heading: the project history is documented by version, not by calendar.
    The blank line after the heading is dropped as well, otherwise the
    rendered section gets two in a row. -#}
{% for entry in tree %}

## {{ entry.version }}
{% for change_key, changes in entry.changes.items() %}

{% if change_key %}
### {{ change_key }}
{% endif %}

{% for change in changes %}
{% if change.scope %}
- **{{ change.scope }}**: {{ change.message }}
{% elif change.message %}
- {{ change.message }}
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% endfor %}
{% endfor %}
